Architecture Principles
Multi-tenant isolation: Row-level security (RLS) in PostgreSQL per dealer_id — no data leakage between tenants
Event-driven: All cross-service communication via AWS EventBridge + SQS FIFO queues
AI-first: Every module exposes tool-use APIs consumable by AI agents (LangGraph tools)
Zero-downtime deploys: Blue/green deployments on Kubernetes (AWS EKS)
Canadian data residency: AWS ca-central-1 primary, us-east-1 failover
Observability: Distributed tracing (Datadog APM), structured JSON logs, RUM for dealer sessions
