6. Database Schema Design
Multi-Tenancy Strategy
All tables include dealer_id UUID NOT NULL with PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS) policies ensuring complete tenant isolation at the database level. Application-level tenant context is set via SET app.current_dealer_id = ? on connection pool checkout.
Core Schema
