8. AI Agent Architecture
Agent Overview
DealerOS ships with 12 purpose-built AI agents built on LangGraph. Every agent is designed to operate autonomously and expose tool-use APIs so it can be triggered by other agents, scheduled jobs, or dealer-configured rules.
Agent Registry

NOVA — Lead Response Agent
Role: First-responder for every inbound lead, 24/7
Trigger: New lead created (any source)
Tech Stack: LangGraph + Claude Sonnet 4 + Twilio SMS + SendGrid
Impact: Close rate +22% from instant response

Workflow:

Lead received → NOVA activates within 30 seconds
Sends personalized intro message (channel: SMS or email based on source)
Asks qualifying questions: vehicle interest, budget, timeline, trade-in
Scores lead and updates CRM
If appointment intent detected → triggers SYNC for scheduling
Generates briefing note for assigned sales rep with full conversation context
If no response in 2 hours → escalates to REVIVE sequence


