Design Philosophy
Premium Automotive SaaS — dark-mode-first, data-dense, fast. Designed for dealers who spend 10-hour shifts in the platform. Every screen is optimized for speed of action: the fastest path from "new lead" to "appointment booked" is always 3 clicks or fewer.
