Principle
Implementation
Dark Mode First
Default dark theme for showroom environments; optional light mode
Command Bar
Global ⌘K palette — jump to any entity or action in <2 keystrokes; supports natural language
Context Panel
Right-side AI context panel on every entity page — NOVA briefing, call transcript, price rec
Real-Time Live Board
WebSocket-driven: leads appear, status changes, rep activity — no page refresh needed
Mobile Responsive
Every dashboard collapses to card view on mobile; manager approval in 2 taps
Keyboard Navigation
Full keyboard accessibility; power users never need mouse for core workflows

