19. Security & Compliance
Security Architecture
Authentication: JWT (15-min access tokens) + rotating refresh tokens stored in httpOnly cookies
Authorization: RBAC enforced at API gateway + service layer + database (RLS)
Encryption at rest: AES-256 for all RDS, S3, and ElastiCache data
Encryption in transit: TLS 1.3 enforced on all endpoints
Secrets management: HashiCorp Vault for all API keys; zero secrets in environment variables
Network isolation: All microservices in private subnets; only Kong gateway is public-facing
WAF: AWS WAF rules for OWASP Top 10, rate limiting, IP reputation
DDoS protection: AWS Shield Standard (upgrade to Advanced for Enterprise tier)
